\item OpenAI, \emph{Strong Ulam Stability Characterizes Amenability}, 2026-10-05; citation key \texttt{OAI:Strong-Ulam-Stability-Characterizes-Amenability-October-5-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Strong-Ulam-Stability-Characterizes-Amenability-October-5-2026/strong-ulam-stability.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Strong-Ulam-Stability-Characterizes-Amenability-October-5-2026/strong-ulam-stability.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Strong-Ulam-Stability-Characterizes-Amenability-October-5-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Strong-Ulam-Stability-Characterizes-Amenability-October-5-2026/strong-ulam-stability.pdf}{Latest version}.
\item Family 251: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/251.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/CONTENTS.md}{OpenAI catalogue entry}.
